class: negative
summary: an atom fact has no value of its own, so compiler.os alone is L0203 in a module value, and compiler.os == linux in a routine body is one L0203 whose atom operand is not reported again as an undeclared name; each note names the module value that holds the comparison
program: main.ldn
codes: L0203, L0203
constructs: 1500, 1560, 1940
targets: linux-x86-64, linux-arm64, darwin-arm64, synthetic-32, freebsd-x86-64, freebsd-arm64, linux-rv64
expect: expected.txt
args: ../tests/fixtures/negative/atom-fact-without-a-comparison/main.ldn
status: 1
